    {
      "start": 6,
      "end": 12,
      "text": {
        "en": "Use the recorded 40 × 80 × 20 mm FOV and −12.145° Z correction for the following BP reconstructions.",
        "zh": "后续 BP 重建统一采用已经确定的 40 × 80 × 20 mm 视野与 −12.145° Z 轴校正。"
      }
    },
    {
      "start": 12,
      "end": 20,
      "text": {
        "en": "Reconstruct every speed on the same final FOV with the same 20 exposures. All candidates share one display window.",
        "zh": "所有声速使用同一批 20 帧，在确定后的 FOV 内重建，并共用同一显示窗。"
      }
    },
    {
      "start": 20,
      "end": 27,
      "text": {
        "en": "Each point is recomputed from a complete floating-point BP MIP. The curve follows measured candidates without fitting.",
        "zh": "每个评分来自完整浮点 BP MIP，曲线依次连接实际候选点。"
      }
    },
